# ~/.claude is mostly local state + plugin-managed files.
# Ignore everything, whitelist only hand-authored, portable config.
# (git still only tracks what's `add`-ed; this guards against `add -A`.)
*
!.gitignore
!statusline-command.sh
!subagent-statusline.py
!rules/
!rules/git-commit.md
!rules/github.md
!hooks/
!hooks/github-signature
!hooks/github-signature.test
!skills/
!skills/pr-risk/
!skills/pr-risk/*
